{
  "$comment": "#EXP-1781: FORCED interaction states, a HOST-ONLY option (never in the catalog or the A2UI schema; every renderer's `forcedStates`: React/Solid/element `forcedStates` prop, core `Surface::set_forced_states`, FFI `setForcedStates`, gpui `EuiView::set_forced_states`, SwiftUI/Compose `forcedStates:`), HAND-AUTHORED and replayed by packages/exponential-ui/src/forced-states.test.ts (the TS reference), packages/exponential-ui-react + -solid `forced-states.test.tsx` (the `data-xs` every painted part carries), apps/desktop/crates/eui-core/tests/forced_states.rs (the core: gpui and the natives through the FFI resolve their visuals there) and the FFI facade tests. A case: `tree`, then `steps` in order (`forced` = the host's whole map, replacing the last; `host` = the host's own interaction states of one node, `set_states`), then `expect` after a layout at 480 \u00d7 900 in the exponential theme, light: `dropped` = what the LAST `forced` refused (`<id>:<state>`), `states` = the forced states each id carries (`focus` = a keyboard focus: `focus` + `focus-visible`; a key covers the node and its parts, ids `<key>.\u2026`; order hover, pressed, focus, focus-visible), `visuals` = resolved visuals the core paints (a subset of keys), `layers` = open overlay layers, `events` = what the core raised (paint only: none). Allowed states: hover, pressed, focus; any other name is dropped, an unknown id is kept (it paints once a node has it).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a forced focus strokes a box Input's field: the key covers the node and its parts",
      "tree": {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "Box",
        "style": {
          "display": "flex",
          "flexDirection": "column",
          "gap": 8
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "inp",
            "component": "Input",
            "props": {
              "label": "Name",
              "name": "name"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "forced": {
            "inp": [
              "focus"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "dropped": [],
        "states": {
